cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: qLDPC
abstract: >-
  qLDPC is a Python toolkit for constructing and analyzing finite-size quantum low-density
  parity-check codes, as well as stabilizer and subsystem codes more broadly.  It provides shared
  implementations and scientific conventions that researchers and their AI assistants can inspect,
  combine, and extend.
authors:
  - family-names: Perlin
    given-names: Michael A.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9316-1596"
date-released: "2023-09-07"
repository-code: "https://github.com/qLDPCOrg/qLDPC"
url: "https://qldpc.readthedocs.io"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - quantum error correction
  - quantum LDPC codes
  - stabilizer codes
  - coding theory
